{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato","soma"],"title":"Uttarā (1st)","html":"<article id='thig1.15'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Therīgāthā 1.15 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Verses of the Senior Nuns 1.15 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Bhikkhunīs </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>Ekakanipāta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Book of the Ones </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Chapter of the Ones </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Uttarātherīgāthā </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Uttarā (1st) </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Verses of the Elder Uttarā </span></h1></header>\n<blockquote class='gatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>“Kāyena saṁvutā āsiṁ, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I was restrained </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>“I was restrained in body, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vācāya uda cetasā; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>in body, speech, and mind. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>speech, and mind. </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Samūlaṁ taṇhamabbuyha, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Having plucked out craving, root and all, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>Having pulled out craving by the roots, </span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>sītibhūtāmhi nibbutā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>I’m cooled and quenched. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>I have become cool and quenched.” </span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>… Uttarā therī …. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span><span class='translation' data-translator='soma'>The Elder Uttarā </span></p></article>"}
